  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A pesar de las condiciones climáticas, se realizó una nueva jornada de trabajo de la Mesa Comunal de Turismo, reuniendo a emprendedores del rubro junto al municipio para compartir experiencias, conocer sus iniciativas y fortalecer el trabajo colaborativo.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La actividad contó con la participación del concejal César Schwarzenberg y tuvo como objetivo generar redes de apoyo, potenciar la colaboración entre los emprendedores y seguir impulsando el desarrollo turístico de la comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏡\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t77/1/16/1f3e1.png\"/> Estas instancias permiten fortalecer los vínculos entre quienes forman parte del turismo local, promoviendo una oferta más integrada y un crecimiento conjunto para Maullín. [Fuente Of Turismo]</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente comunicaciones munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11714\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/0tcamfq5bsjqntc/turis_07_1024x683_ucwt334ocy.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-71 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11707\" data-id=\"11707\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/rla9cfascz3q33h/turis_01_1024x683_u7jvj2ster.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11706\" data-id=\"11706\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/l3oovlrry539gch/turis_02_1024x683_ss2n48wjxn.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11711\" data-id=\"11711\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/mgj9tyu9vo0q03h/turis_04_1024x683_yhua17az1r.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11713\" data-id=\"11713\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/tao8wtx3a5x3kvk/turis_06_1024x683_8v9sfro7g1.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11712\" data-id=\"11712\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/mlia9ynk8e6gys2/turis_08_1024x683_8vzgrj7cwy.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11716\" data-id=\"11716\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/dl1nura7ndp5vma/turis_09_1024x683_dfqw2bdp2s.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-blo